msgid "Normal eligible POS catalog variants, in ID order. Contextual special, tip, combo, optional, and previously ordered products are excluded. POS limited loading may show a different first subset. Other-company taxes excluded by POS are flagged without naming them. Flags are advisory; ask your accountant or localization owner about legally correct tax rates."
